.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt OSSL_PROVIDER-LEGACY 7ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm OSSL_PROVIDER-legacy
.Nd OpenSSL legacy provider
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The OpenSSL legacy provider supplies OpenSSL implementations of
algorithms that have been deemed legacy.
Such algorithms have commonly fallen out of use, have been deemed
insecure by the cryptography community, or something similar.
.Pp
We can consider this the retirement home of cryptographic algorithms.
.Ss Properties
The implementations in this provider specifically has this property
defined:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \(dqprovider=legacy"
.El
It may be used in a property query string with fetching functions such
as
.Xr EVP_MD_fetch 3
or
.Xr EVP_CIPHER_fetch 3 ,
as well as with other functions that take a property query string, such
as
.Xr EVP_PKEY_CTX_new_from_name 3 .
.Pp
It isn't mandatory to query for any of these properties, except to make
sure to get implementations of this provider and none other.
.Sh OPERATIONS AND ALGORITHMS
The OpenSSL legacy provider supports these operations and algorithms:
.Ss Hashing Algorithms / Message Digests
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It MD2, see Xr EVP_MD-MD2 7
Disabled by default.
Use
.Em enable-md2
config option to enable.
.It MD4, see Xr EVP_MD-MD4 7
.It MDC2, see Xr EVP_MD-MDC2 7
.It WHIRLPOOL, see Xr EVP_MD-WHIRLPOOL 7
.It RIPEMD160, see Xr EVP_MD-RIPEMD160 7
.El
.Ss Symmetric Ciphers
Not all of these symmetric cipher algorithms are enabled by default.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Blowfish, see Xr EVP_CIPHER-BLOWFISH 7
.It CAST, see Xr EVP_CIPHER-CAST 7
.It DES, see Xr EVP_CIPHER-DES 7
The algorithm names are: DES_ECB, DES_CBC, DES_OFB, DES_CFB, DES_CFB1,
DES_CFB8 and DESX_CBC.
.It IDEA, see Xr EVP_CIPHER-IDEA 7
.It RC2, see Xr EVP_CIPHER-RC2 7
.It RC4, see Xr EVP_CIPHER-RC4 7
.It RC5, see Xr EVP_CIPHER-RC5 7
Disabled by default.
Use
.Em enable-rc5
config option to enable.
.It SEED, see Xr EVP_CIPHER-SEED 7
.El
.Ss Key Derivation Function (KDF)
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It PBKDF1
.It PVKKDF
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr OSSL_PARAM 3 ,
.Xr openssl-core.h 7 ,
.Xr openssl-core_dispatch.h 7 ,
.Xr provider 7
.Sh HISTORY
This functionality was added in OpenSSL 3.0.
